<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetSunDirection(): vector`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`vector llGetSunDirection();`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a normalized vector to the current sun position at the location of object containing the script. llGetSunDirection is the vector to the parcel&#39;s sun, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetRegionSunDirection" target="_blank">llGetRegionSunDirection</a> is the vector to region&#39;s sun. If there is no custom environment set for the current parcel llGetSunDirection returns the direction to the region&#39;s sun. These functions are altitude aware.</p>
  <p>Returns a vector</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
